    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23269" root="شوذ" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِشْوَذٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A turban;</i> (IAar, S, Mgh, L, Msb, K;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِشْوَاذٌ</span></b> : (K:) pl. of the former <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشَاوِذُ</span>;
(S, Mgh, L, Msb, K;) and of the latter <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشَاوِيذُ</span>.
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A king:</i> (K:) <i>a crowned king.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A lord,</i> or <i>chief,</i> (K,) <i>to whom obedience is
paid.</i> (TA.)

